{%- comment -%}
  Tracking Code Snippet
  ---------------------
  Add your tracking and analytics code below based on location.

  This snippet is rendered in multiple locations:
  - 'head': In the <head> section (for main tracking scripts)
  - 'body': Right after opening <body> tag (for noscript fallbacks)

  Usage in theme.liquid:
    {% render 'tracking', location: 'head' %}
    {% render 'tracking', location: 'body' %}

  Common tracking codes:
  - Google Tag Manager (requires both head and body locations)
  - Google Analytics (GA4) - head only
  - Facebook Pixel - head only
  - Other third-party tracking scripts

  Note: Shopify's built-in analytics are already included via {{ content_for_header }}.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% case location %}
{% when 'head' %}
  {%- comment -%} Add tracking scripts for <head> section below {%- endcomment -%}

{% when 'body' %}
  {%- comment -%} Add tracking scripts for <body> section below (e.g., noscript tags) {%- endcomment -%}

{% endcase %}
